                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">Additionally it could set a wildcard flag (EthSwtStreamHandleIdWildcard), where any assigned stream handle id carried by an Ethernet frame would match to this stream filter.</L-1>
                                        </P>
