                                          <SHORT-NAME>EthSwtPortEgressQueueCreditBasedShaperIdleSlope</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <DESC>
                                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines the increase of credit in bits per second for the AVB shaper.</L-2>
