                              <SHORT-NAME>EthSwtPortIngressVlanTranslationTable</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container defines 0..* entries of the form (IngressVlanID, TranslatedVlanID) that define the ingress Vlan translation. The IngressVlanID is the VlanID read from the incoming frame upon reception (ingress), which is replaced by the corresponding TranslatedVlanID upon ingress Vlan translation.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthSwt_00256</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
